From 8d5fbf3b66d478a909924a70f5dfd96d65e581db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] VPVulkan: bounded pipeline memory (archive open budget
 measured per file, lazy game device with archives, memory-capped prewarm
 otherwise, lean recipe store, gpu.mem lines, retirement footprint check)

